[{"id":3032472412,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc60v9tc","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"91a4a28aab58d3f1b3d40c0d2385ebb4caadb649","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"Seems reasonable to expose it, and always handle padding on the engine side.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108725#pullrequestreview-3032472412","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108725","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-18T08:06:09Z"},{"id":3032883028,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc60xh9U","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"91a4a28aab58d3f1b3d40c0d2385ebb4caadb649","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"I totally missed that godot-cpp was doing its own pre-padding.\nFully agreed this is the right way to fix it. Additionally, this should fix double pre-padding (once by godot-cpp and once by godot), which may also have caused issues, in addition to wasting RAM.\n\nI'd go as far to say as we should consider squeezing this into 4.5. As a new interface, it should be impossible for this to introduce new bugs, and it would be nice to already use it with godot-cpp in the 4.5 release (rather than in half a year from now).","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108725#pullrequestreview-3032883028","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108725","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-18T09:40:00Z"},{"id":3045014812,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc61fz0c","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"91a4a28aab58d3f1b3d40c0d2385ebb4caadb649","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?u=24618295fece29a0bf5c850faf2555985232f5f2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","login":"aaronfranke","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke"},"body":"Looks good to me. As discussed in the GDExtension meeting, we should also, as a follow-up PR, warn whenever there is a mismatch between release and debug, and/or warn whenever the `.gdextension` file has a configuration that could lead to a mismatch.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108725#pullrequestreview-3045014812","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108725","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-22T22:10:59Z"}]